Steps to get API key in AI Studio:

1.Open AI Studio → Go to Google AI Studio.

2.Sign in → Use your Google account.

3.Go To Dashboard

4.Get API key → On the dashboard, click Get API key.

5.Copy the key → The key will be shown once. Copy it and store it safely.
